From 4d1e802f8729bc56bd571a09d57889e9141d8bef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:19:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] POC-9: NaviCust for every Pokemon (5x4 board, 48 programs,
 bugs, pkbn.sav sidecar)

Every Pokemon gets its own BN6-style NaviCust: the ability is a built-in
program, program colours are types (own types never bug), Pokeblock
conditions compress programs, active Pokerus softens bugs. Programs and
bugs act in grid battles. Layouts live in pkbn.sav, keyed by a Navi ID in
BoxPokemon.unknown. Also fixes POC-7 trainer prize money (loop variable
reuse: Roxanne pays 1500).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
