+    // Buster Attack (BN6 levels 1-5): damage x level. Charge (design): our buster fires while B is held, so instead of
+    // BN's hold-to-charge, every 8th / 6th / 5th / 4th shot at Charge 2 / 3 / 4 / 5 is a x10 charged shot.
